    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>This plugin offers a variety of layouts, making it easy for users to display their content effectively. Available layout types include Grid, List, Carousel, and more—allowing users to choose the style that best suits their needs.</p>\n<p>Each layout comes with customizable settings, enabling adjustments to the number of content items, colors, fonts, and other visual elements. The plugin is user-friendly and fully compatible with any website, making it a versatile solution for content presentation.</p>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Default layout available.</li>\n<li>Set card border, padding, and border radius.</li>\n<li>Customize card title, description, and button typography, color, padding, and border radius.</li>\n<li>Set card URL and button URL now open in a new tab .</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How to use Plugin Name</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>First, install the Plugin Name plugin from the WordPress dashboard.</li>\n<li>Add the Cards Layout from the block category called &#8220;widgets&#8221; in the Gutenberg editor.</li>\n<li>You can change block settings from the right-side settings sidebar.</li>\n<li>\n<p>Enjoy!</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>For installation help click on Installation Tab</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>&#8211; Did you like this plugin? Dislike it? Have a feature request? [Please share your feedback with us](mailto:omor45faruk@gmail.com</h4>\n<p>&#8216;Send feedback&#8217;)</p>\n",
        "installation": "<h3>From Gutenberg Editor:</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Go to the WordPress Block/Gutenberg Editor</li>\n<li>Search For <strong>Cards Layout</strong></li>\n<li>Click on the <strong>Cards Layout</strong> to add the block</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>Download &amp; Upload:</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Download the <strong>Cards Layout</strong> plugin (<em>.zip file</em>)</li>\n<li>In your admin area, go to the Plugins menu and click on <strong>Add New</strong></li>\n<li>Click on <strong>Upload Plugin</strong> and choose the <strong><code>cards-layout.zip</code></strong> file and click on <strong>Install Now</strong></li>\n<li>Activate the plugin and Enjoy!</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>Manually:</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Download and upload the <strong>Cards Layout</strong> plugin to the <strong><code>/wp-content/plugins/</code></strong> directory</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the Plugins menu in WordPress</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='does%20it%20work%20with%20any%20wordpress%20theme%3F'>\nDoes it work with any WordPress theme?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, it will work with any standard WordPress theme.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='can%20i%20change%20block%20settings%3F'>\nCan I change block settings?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, you can change block settings from the Gutenberg block editor&#8217;s right sidebar.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='how%20many%20times%20can%20i%20reuse%20a%20block%3F'>\nHow many times can I reuse a block?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>You can use unlimited times as you want.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='where%20can%20i%20get%20support%3F'>\nWhere can I get support?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>You can post your questions on the <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/support/plugin/plugin-slug/\" rel=\"ugc\">support forum here</a></p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.1.3 &#8211; 27 July, 2025</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Import content from image media;</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.1.2 &#8211; 9 July, 2025</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Image border radius and card content align option added</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.1.1 &#8211; 6 July, 2025</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Card URL and button URL now open in a new tab;</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.1.0 &#8211; 4 July, 2025</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Default layout available</li>\n<li>Set card border, padding, and border radius</li>\n<li>Customize card title, description, and button typography, color, padding, and border radius</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial Release</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "This plugin offers multiple customizable layouts like grid, list, and carousel, making content display easy and flexible.",
    "description": "<p>This plugin offers a variety of layouts, making it easy for users to display their content effectively. Available layout types include Grid, List, Carousel, and more—allowing users to choose the style that best suits their needs.</p>\n<p>Each layout comes with customizable settings, enabling adjustments to the number of content items, colors, fonts, and other visual elements. The plugin is user-friendly and fully compatible with any website, making it a versatile solution for content presentation.</p>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Default layout available.</li>\n<li>Set card border, padding, and border radius.</li>\n<li>Customize card title, description, and button typography, color, padding, and border radius.</li>\n<li>Set card URL and button URL now open in a new tab .</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How to use Plugin Name</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>First, install the Plugin Name plugin from the WordPress dashboard.</li>\n<li>Add the Cards Layout from the block category called &#8220;widgets&#8221; in the Gutenberg editor.</li>\n<li>You can change block settings from the right-side settings sidebar.</li>\n<li>\n<p>Enjoy!</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>For installation help click on Installation Tab</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>&#8211; Did you like this plugin? Dislike it? Have a feature request? [Please share your feedback with us](mailto:omor45faruk@gmail.com</h4>\n<p>&#8216;Send feedback&#8217;)</p>\n",
